// WAVE 13: STARLINK ORBITAL MESH & NEURALINK CLOUD SINGULARITY
// 1. POST /api/project/:projectId/wave13/starlink-orbital-probe
// 2. POST /api/project/:projectId/wave13/starlink-failover-execute
